@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il08-nouns`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Figures PUBLISHED BY THE ISRAEL TAX AUTHORITY for ss 45A and 47. NOT ENCODED LAW.
--
-- The amounts ss 45A and 47 print (1,632; 84,000; 118,800) are adjusted under s 120B (row IL-03),
-- frozen for 2025-2027 at their 1 January 2024 figure after rounding (s 120B(e)(1), line 4344), and
-- the average wage is the National Insurance Institute's. The rules take all four as inputs. This
-- module records what the Tax Authority has published, so that tests and callers can use a sourced
-- figure rather than an invented one.
--
-- [booklet-YYYY] The Tax Authority's monthly withholding booklet ("an aid to computing income tax on
--   salary and wages"), chapter C ("amounts adjusted for the tax year"), part B ("provident funds and
--   study funds"); the Hebrew titles are on the ext: lines below.
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | לוח עזר לחישוב מס הכנסה ממשכורת ושכר עבודה
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | פרק ג  -סכומים מתואמים לשנת המס 2026
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | ב .קופות גמל וקרנות השתלמות
--   gov.il URL: https://www.gov.il/BlobFolder/generalpage/income-tax-monthly-deductions-booklet/he/generalInformation_income-tax-monthly-deductions-booklet_monthly-deductions-booklet-YYYY.pdf
--   2026: fetched by this row on 2026-10-06T23:46:08Z as the raw bytes of Internet Archive capture
--         20260207101513 (https://web.archive.org/web/20260207101513id_/<that URL>), 36 pp., 610,829
--         bytes, sha256 282bb886ccae1cc718840127af378fce88ca37ee3b2b9f00ed2cd44467e86285 (the same
--         bytes row IL-01 recorded); the part is on PDF p. 9.
--   2024 and 2025: the copies row IL-01 fetched on 2026-10-06 (captures 20240117140817 and
--         20251222010537; sha256 35aed117... and 41496dd3..., in IL-01's published-figures module),
--         read for the cross-check below; not re-fetched.
--   Quotations are `pdftotext -layout` output with bidi controls removed, each label's lines joined
--   with " / "; the extractor scrambles bracketed numerals, so "(47א)( - )1()1" is the booklet's
--   "47(א)(1)(1)" and "45א(ה)()2" its "45א(ה)(2)". Checked by script against the extracted page.
--
-- What the booklet prints for 2026 (PDF p. 9): label | figure | per month ("לחודש") or per year ("לשנה").
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | תקרת הכנסה מזכה (47א)( - )1()1רק / מהכנסת עבודה | 9,700 | לחודש
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | תקרת הכנסה מזכה (47א)( - )2()1לא / מהכנסת עבודה | 13,700 | לחודש
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | תקרת הסכום לזיכוי בעד דמי ביטוח ותגמולים / 45א(ד) | 189 | לחודש
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | תקרת הסכום לזיכוי בעד דמי ביטוח ותגמולים / 45א(ה)()1 | 189 | לחודש
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | תקרת הסכום לזיכוי בעד דמי ביטוח ותגמולים / 45א(ה)()2 | 19,400 | לחודש
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | תקרת הכנסה לעמית עצמאי (47א) | 9,700 | לחודש
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | תקרת הכנסה נוספת (47א)()5 | 24,250 | לחודש
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | שכר ממוצע במשק | 13,769
-- ext:[booklet-2026] | עמית מוטב (47א)()7 | 26,436 | לשנה
-- The 2024 and 2025 booklets print the same first seven figures, and 12,536 and 24,069 for the last
-- two: the freeze of s 120B(e)(1) shows in the first seven, and the average wage moved in 2026.
--
-- PER MONTH AND PER YEAR (assumption A3, NOTES.md). The Ordinance states these amounts per year
-- ("לשנה", s 47(a)(1)); the booklet, for withholding from a month's salary, per month. This module
-- derives the yearly figure as twelve times the monthly one and says so in every name that does.
-- Three things support it and none proves it: the booklet's own yearly beneficiary-member figure,
-- 26,436, is 16% of twelve times 13,769 (26,436.48) to the shekel below; its 19,400 for s 45A(e)(2)
-- is twice 9,700, as s 45A(e)(2)(b) is twice the paragraph (1) amount; and its 24,250 for "additional
-- income" is two and a half times 9,700, as s 47(a)(5)(2) is. No yearly publication of the four
-- figures for 2024-2026 was sourced.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Figures for sections 45A and 47 published by the Israel Tax Authority — not encoded law`

@ref Israel Tax Authority, no withholding-booklet figure for ss 45A and 47 sourced for this tax year
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`no Tax Authority figure for sections 45A and 47 has been sourced for this tax year` MEANS
    REFUSE "no Tax Authority figure for sections 45A and 47 has been sourced for this tax year"

DECLARE `The monthly figures of the withholding booklet for sections 45A and 47` HAS
    `the ceiling of qualifying income, work income only, per month`           IS A NUMBER
    `the ceiling of qualifying income, not work income, per month`            IS A NUMBER
    `the ceiling of the sum credited under section 45A(d), per month`         IS A NUMBER
    `the average wage in the economy, per month`                              IS A NUMBER
    `the least sum for a beneficiary member, per year`                        IS A NUMBER

@ref [booklet-2024] p. 11; [booklet-2025] p. 10; [booklet-2026] p. 9
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER  @desc the tax year, e.g. 2026
GIVETH A `The monthly figures of the withholding booklet for sections 45A and 47`
`the Tax Authority's withholding-booklet figures for sections 45A and 47, for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    --                                                                            9,700   13,700   189   avg wage  beneficiary
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2026 THEN `The monthly figures of the withholding booklet for sections 45A and 47` OF 9700, 13700, 189, 13769, 26436
           IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2025 THEN `The monthly figures of the withholding booklet for sections 45A and 47` OF 9700, 13700, 189, 12536, 24069
           IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2024 THEN `The monthly figures of the withholding booklet for sections 45A and 47` OF 9700, 13700, 189, 12536, 24069
           OTHERWISE `no Tax Authority figure for sections 45A and 47 has been sourced for this tax year`

-- Assumption A3: the yearly amount is twelve times the booklet's monthly figure.
@ref assumption A3 (NOTES.md): twelve times the withholding booklet's monthly figures
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER  @desc the tax year, e.g. 2026
GIVETH A `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year`
`the amounts of sections 45A and 47, as twelve times the Tax Authority's monthly figures, for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    `The amounts of sections 45A and 47 in force in the tax year` WITH
        `the amount in section 45A(d)(1)`                                    IS 12 TIMES `m`'s `the ceiling of the sum credited under section 45A(d), per month`
        `the amount in paragraph (1) of the definition of qualifying income` IS 12 TIMES `m`'s `the ceiling of qualifying income, work income only, per month`
        `the amount in paragraph (2) of the definition of qualifying income` IS 12 TIMES `m`'s `the ceiling of qualifying income, not work income, per month`
        `the average wage in the economy, in total for the tax year`         IS 12 TIMES `m`'s `the average wage in the economy, per month`
    WHERE `m` MEANS `the Tax Authority's withholding-booklet figures for sections 45A and 47, for tax year` `the tax year`
